    {
      "bbox": [
        114,
        1085,
        1447,
        1284
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "FROM: ROBERT F. WAGNER, MAYOR\n\nTO: HEADS OF ALL AGENCIES AND DEPARTMENTS\n\nSUBJECT: ASSIGNMENT AND USE OF PASSENGER CARS AND CHAUFFEURS",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2684,
          "min": -1.4448
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.001,
          "min": -0.001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 50,
          "mean": -0.016,
          "min": -0.6933
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 1405,
        "area_px": 237400,
        "density": 0.00592,
        "chars": 134,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 95.37
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        118,
        1329,
        1845,
        1439
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "As you must know, by this time, it is my intention to limit the use of\ncity-owned passenger cars to the barest minimum, consistent with efficient operation of\nthe city's business.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2741,
          "min": -1.5481
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 41,
          "mean": -0.0152,
          "min": -0.5802
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2142,
        "area_px": 174240,
        "density": 0.01229,
        "chars": 179,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 83.57
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        118,
        1484,
        1920,
        1682
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "To attain this end, I have empowered the Deputy Mayor and Budget Director\nto take the necessary steps to provide for the proper supervision of the use and assignment\nof cars and chauffeurs, as well as to study the operation of the city's maintenance and\nrepair facilities. In connection therewith, they have, in cooperation with the major\ncity using agencies, developed the attached set of rules and regulations.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2488,
          "min": -1.3205
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 84,
          "mean": -0.0063,
          "min": -0.4928
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4536,
        "area_px": 320390,
        "density": 0.01416,
        "chars": 412,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 90.83
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        118,
        1721,
        1802,
        1795
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "You are hereby directed to apply these rules in the assignment of any\nvehicles under your jurisdiction.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2241,
          "min": -1.4855
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.0015,
          "min": -0.0164
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 1080,
        "area_px": 115575,
        "density": 0.00934,
        "chars": 103,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 95.37
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        118,
        1840,
        1896,
        2113
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Although the Deputy Mayor and Budget Director will have certain responsibilities in implementing this program, you, as a Commissioner are not relieved of your responsibility with regard to the proper assignment and use of these vehicles. I am, particularly, concerned with the possibility of unnecessary assignments or the use of city cars for other than official city business. As the official on the spot more closely associated with the individuals to whom car assignments are made, you are in the best position to prevent any departures from these rules.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2237,
          "min": -1.3612
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 98,
          "mean": -0.0007,
          "min": -0.0231
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6349,
        "area_px": 439530,
        "density": 0.01444,
        "chars": 558,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 87.89
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        118,
        2155,
        1872,
        2238
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "You are, therefore, directed to take the necessary steps to insure strict\ncompliance with regard to the proper and efficient use of the vehicles in your agency.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2135,
          "min": -1.3201
        },
        "category": {
